{
    "id":  26612,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "WL-SW1 Smart WiFi Switch 2.4GHz 100-240V 10A",
    "reference":  "FL7165",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart WiFi Switch 2.4GHz \u003c/strong\u003efor home automation, \u003cstrong\u003ecompatible with the Tuya Smart app and voice control via Alexa and Google Assistant. \u003c/strong\u003eManage lights, fans, heating and other electrical devices from your smartphone or via voice commands. \u003cstrong\u003eIncludes multiple timer function\u003c/strong\u003e, stable 2.4G connection with a range of up to 30 m and compatibility with push-button or toggle switches. A practical solution to turn your home into a more comfortable, efficient and connected space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eSmart WiFi Switch WL-SW1 2.4GHz 100-240V 10A | Tuya Smart Control | Compatible with Alexa and Google Assistant | Efficient Home Automation for Connected Homes\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSmart WiFi Switch WL-SW1 2.4GHz 100-240V 10A\u003c/strong\u003e is an advanced home automation solution designed to transform any traditional electrical installation into a smart, comfortable and efficient system. It allows you to control lights, fans, heating and other electrical devices directly from your mobile phone or via voice commands, providing greater comfort, automation and energy savings in homes, offices and connected spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks to its compatibility with the \u003cstrong\u003eTuya Smart\u003c/strong\u003e application, this smart switch offers full control of devices from anywhere, allowing you to turn on, turn off and manage electrical equipment easily. It is also compatible with \u003cstrong\u003eAlexa and Google Assistant\u003c/strong\u003e, facilitating integration with smart home ecosystems and enabling actions via voice commands without the need to use physical switches.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eWiFi 2.4GHz\u003c/strong\u003e connection ensures stable and reliable communication with a range of up to \u003cstrong\u003e30 metres\u003c/strong\u003e, offering optimal performance in domestic installations. This technology eliminates the need for hubs or additional devices, simplifying installation and reducing costs to convert any space into a more connected environment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Switch WL-SW1 supports a voltage of 100-240V and a maximum load of 10A\u003c/strong\u003e, being compatible with multiple home applications. Its design allows you to manage different electrical equipment, providing a versatile solution for both new installations and modernisations of existing homes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of its main advantages is the \u003cstrong\u003emultiple timer function\u003c/strong\u003e, which allows you to schedule automatic on and off times according to the user\u0027s needs. This function helps to optimise electricity consumption, avoid unnecessary expenses and improve the energy efficiency of the home, creating customised routines for lighting and other devices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts compatibility with \u003cstrong\u003epush-button or toggle switches\u003c/strong\u003e facilitates integration into current installations, maintaining the possibility of controlling devices both manually and intelligently. This flexibility makes it an ideal option for renovation projects, new homes and residential automation systems.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRecommended Uses and Applications\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for home automation and smart control projects in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart homes and apartments\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eResidential LED lighting\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOffices and workspaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFan and climate control\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRoom automation\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRenovations with home automation integration\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnected home projects\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEfficient electrical installations\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn summary, the \u003cstrong\u003eSmart WiFi Switch WL-SW1\u003c/strong\u003e is a safe investment for those looking to improve the comfort, efficiency and control of their electrical installations. Its WiFi connectivity, compatibility with voice assistants and scheduling functions allow you to reduce consumption, increase daily comfort and move towards a smarter and more sustainable home. A practical solution for installers and users who want to incorporate home automation simply and cost-effectively.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
